<section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 py-16">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 text-center">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-center mb-10">Last updated: <%= currentYear %></p>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        At <%= siteTitle %>, we take your privacy seriously. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, how we protect it, and your rights under applicable data protection laws.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">1. Data Controller</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">The data controller for this website is <%= siteTitle %>. You can contact us through the <a href="/contact" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline">Contact</a> page for any privacy-related inquiries.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">2. Information We Collect</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li><strong>Video URLs:</strong> The URL you submit for processing. We do not store it permanently.</li>
        <li><strong>Log data:</strong> Basic request metadata such as IP address, timestamp, and requested path for security and operational purposes.</li>
        <li><strong>Cookies and local storage:</strong> Used only for essential functionality (e.g., theme preference) and, if enabled, advertising partners.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">3. How We Use Information</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">We use the information we collect to operate the service, prevent abuse, improve performance, and display relevant advertisements if you have enabled ads.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">4. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">We do not use intrusive tracking cookies. We may use essential cookies for site functionality and, if advertising is enabled, third-party cookies for ad personalization. See our <a href="/cookie-policy" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline">Cookie Policy</a> for details.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">5. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">We may display advertisements through Google AdSense. Please review <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline">Google’s Privacy Policy</a> for details on how Google processes ad data. We also use open-source libraries such as yt-dlp to process video URLs.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">6. Data Retention</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Video URLs and downloaded files are processed temporarily and are not retained after the download is complete. Server logs are rotated periodically.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">7. Your Rights</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Depending on your location, you may have rights to access, correct, delete, or restrict the processing of your personal data. To exercise these rights, contact us through the <a href="/contact" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline">Contact</a> page.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">8. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Our service is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided us with personal data, please contact us to have it removed.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">9. GDPR / CCPA Compliance</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">We process data lawfully, fairly, and transparently. Users in the EU and California have the right to request information about the data we hold and to request deletion. We do not sell personal information.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Continued use of the service after changes means you accept the updated policy.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">11. Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">For privacy questions, please use the <a href="/contact" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline">Contact</a> page.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
